          "en": "OpenAI is scaling its Stargate project to develop compute infrastructure for AGI, increasing data center capacity to address rising AI demand.",
          "zh": "OpenAI 正在扩展其 Stargate 项目，以构建支持 AGI 的计算基础设施，并增加数据中心容量以满足日益增长的 AI 需求。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
