            "The initiative aims to build compute infrastructure for Artificial General Intelligence (AGI).",
            "New data center capacity is being added to meet growing AI demand."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "OpenAI 正在扩展其内部的 Stargate 项目。",
            "该计划旨在构建用于通用人工智能 (AGI) 的计算基础设施。",
            "正在增加新的数据中心容量以满足日益增长的 AI 需求。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
